<title>FRANCE: Saudi Arabia seeks 500,000 T optional barley.</title>
<headline>Saudi Arabia seeks 500,000 T optional barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia is in the market to import 500,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley for January delivery, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The exact date of the tender was not immediately available but traders said Saudi Arabia was likely to tender for the barley on Tuesday or Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
